==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈl̥aiːja]|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|aiːja|lang=is}}
*: Homophones: [[hlægja]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} ''[[#Old Norse|hlæja]]''.

===Verb===
'''hlæja''' (''strong conjugation:'' [[hló]] – [[hlógum]] – [[hlegið]])

# {{intransitive}} to [[laugh]]

====Derived terms====
* [[hlægja]]
* [[hlæja hátt]] (to laugh [[loud]])
* [[hlæja að]]
* [[hlæja hugur við]] (to gladden one's heart)
*: ''Þau tíðindi, er þeim '''hló hugur við'''.''
*:: The tidings, that '''gladdened''' their '''hearts.

====Related terms====
* [[hlátur]]

